keywords: [League of Legends, esports, Elo, tournament design, Monte Carlo, Worlds]
abstract: >-
  Elo ratings of every professional League of Legends team since 2011, simulators for every Worlds format 2014-2026,
  a test of T1's Worlds-only over-performance, and a comparison of tournament formats with parallels from other sports.
notes: >-
  Every step of this analysis, from downloading the data through the Elo ratings, the tournament simulators and the
  comparisons, to the charts, was written and executed by Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), working from Riccardo
  Gallotti's instructions. He set the questions and the framing; the model did the work.
